spacefm (1.0.7-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Do not ship the upstream spacefm-installer net installer in
    Debian/Ubuntu binary packages.
  * Keep spacefm-installer in the upstream source tree while excluding
    it and its packaging-specific manual page from the binary package.
  * Require libtoolize during bootstrap before running autogen.sh.
  * Remove the unused console-output build implementation.
  * Generate spacefm-auth from a configure template so --with-bash-path
    works with out-of-tree builds without modifying the source tree.
  * New upstream maintained release 1.0.7.
  * Transition from the 1.0.6+reaper snapshot series to the formal 1.0.7
    release.

 -- Reaper <JohnGrimmReaper@disroot.org>  Fri, 07 Aug 2026 02:41:40 +0000

spacefm (1.0.6+reaper8-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Include the tree-view drag-motion fix from upstream PR #704.
  * Drop the obsolete -fcommon build workaround after integrating the
    GCC 10 global declaration fixes.
  * Follow the current freedesktop.org thumbnail cache locations.
  * Drop legacy GNOME2_DIR handling from autogen.sh.
  * Add search keywords to the SpaceFM desktop entries.
  * Correct the spelling of "occurred" across source files, manuals, and
    gettext catalogs.
  * Add Daniel Lopez's optional close-on-last-tab behavior for panels
    and the application.

 -- Reaper <JohnGrimmReaper@disroot.org>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 19:01:33 +0000

spacefm (1.0.6+reaper7-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Update Korean translation from upstream PR #804.
  * Update Russian translation from upstream PR #741.
  * Include aft-mtp-mount support for MTP mounts from upstream PR #757.
  * New maintained SpaceFM package based on upstream 1.0.6.
  * Include crash fix for unmounting volumes.
  * Include C23/compiler compatibility fixes.
  * Include sys/sysmacros.h for major()/minor() declarations on modern Linux.
  * Include GCC 10.1+ build fixes from upstream PR #772.
  * Include Btrfs clone ioctl support from upstream PR #640.
  * Build-depend on libbtrfs-dev so Btrfs clone support is enabled.
  * Include dash-compatible configure fixes from upstream PR #813.
  * Include reviewed GCC 14 build fixes from upstream PR #816.
  * Include activation fix for selected items without focus from upstream PR #749.
  * Include parent navigation on empty-area double-click inspired by upstream PR #699.
  * Build GTK2 interface with libudev, startup notification, desktop integration,
    and video thumbnail support enabled.
  * Add -fcommon build flag for compatibility with legacy global
    definitions under modern GCC.

